Z||000000||Butter||06-04-2001||11:24 AM||||Hey Yall,<BR>I was wantn' to change my speedometer and Tachometer calibrations.<BR>  <BR>1.  I found a website that shows to change the capacitor on the tach board in order to make it register properly for a v8.  This site <A HREF="http://www.thefieroclub.net/osg/tachmod.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.thefieroclub.net/osg/tachmod.html</A>  shows .01, .0082 and .0064 uf capacitors for 4,6 and 8 cylinders.  The only capacitor I found on my board was a .047 uf I believe.  I will confirm this at lunch.  I once found another website that showed a picture of the board and capacitor but I cannot find the site now.  Can anyone help with this?<P>2. I wanted to change the calibration of my speedometer so I could use the metric numbers for mph.  This would make a 140 mph out of an 85 mph speedometer if I can find out what component to change.  Does anyone have any info on any of the modifications I seek?||||reg||5
